C*******************************************************************************
C
C                  INTEGRATED WATER FLOW MODEL (IWFM)
C
C*******************************************************************************
C
C                       STREAM SPECIFICATION FILE
C                           Stream Component
C                          *** Version 4.2 ***
C
C
C             Project:  C2VSim Coarse Grid (C2VSimCG)
C                       California Central Valley Groundwater-Surface Water Simulation Model
C             Filename: C2VSimCG_Streams.dat
C             Version:  C2VSimCG v2025 
C
C             Note:  Stream reaches in the C2VSim coarse-grid model are based
C                      on the stream reaches of the C2VSim fine-grid model. In
C                      some cases a fine-grid reach is smaller than the 
C                      coarse-grid element size and was omitted from this
C                      coarse-grid model. These omitted reaches are explained 
C                      with comments in this file.
C                    Several stream reaches were also added representing water
C                      conveyance canals
C                    Added two Delta reaches, Old River from near Webb Tract to
C                      Clifton Court Forebay and Old River from near Stewart
C                      Tract to Clifton Court Forebay
C                    Adjusted stream depths so water level always above sea level
C
